```java
int day = 2;
switch (day) {
    case 1: System.out.println("Monday");
    case 2: System.out.println("Tuesday");   // matches here
    case 3: System.out.println("Wednesday"); // falls through and runs
    default: System.out.println("Other");    // also runs
}
// Prints: Tuesday, Wednesday, Other
```

```java
